---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Deep Tissue Massage | Nikki Leonardi Bodywork Traverse City" description="Real deep tissue work by a 13-year specialist. Not about pushing harder — about knowing where to go and why. Traverse City, MI.">
  <div class="pt-16">
    <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-[#162040]">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <p class="section-label mb-4">Deep Tissue</p>
        <h1 class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-5xl text-[#f0f4ff] leading-tight mb-6">Deep tissue done right —<br/><em class="text-[#c8a84b]">by someone who actually<br/>knows where to go.</em></h1>
        <div class="gold-line mt-8"></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-[#0d1428]">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 text-[#c8a84b]/70 leading-relaxed text-lg">
        <p>Deep tissue massage is one of the most requested services I offer — and also one of the most misunderstood. Real deep tissue work isn't about pushing harder. It's about knowing what's holding the tension, why it's there, and how to address it without fighting the body.</p>
        <p>Thirteen years of practice means I know the difference between discomfort that's productive and pressure that's just pain. I work with the body, not against it.</p>
        <p class="font-['Playfair_Display'] text-xl text-[#f0f4ff] italic">"She is very knowledgeable about the body and the muscle. I'm glad I opened up my mind and tried something different."</p>
        <p class="text-[#c8a84b]/40 text-sm">— Albert Patrick</p>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-12">
        <a href="/book" class="btn-primary">Book a Deep Tissue Session</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
